<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Maxim Integrated started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Maxim Integrated started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley &amp; Co said its analyst Dan Meyers started coverage of Maxim Integrated Products Inc with a strong buy rating on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-9/16 to 47-11/16.</p>
<p>-- The company supplies analog products for applications that require real world signal processing.</p>
</text>
